312
00:11:46,810 --> 00:11:47,150
¿Y qué?

313
00:11:47,350 --> 00:11:48,270
Eso no cambia nada.

314
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:52,570
Esto se conecta con diferentes partes de la

315
00:11:52,570 --> 00:11:52,810
