377
00:14:19,030 --> 00:14:19,370
Entra.

378
00:14:19,710 --> 00:14:22,090
Tiene agujeros para tus largas piernas.

379
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:23,810
Sí.

380
00:14:24,090 --> 00:14:24,910
