403
00:15:44,190 --> 00:15:45,110
¡Amity, aléjate!

404
00:15:45,350 --> 00:15:46,290
¡Es una farsante!

405
00:15:58,130 --> 00:16:01,090
Tomamos este coeficiente, lo llevamos a dos, resolvemos

406
00:16:01,090 --> 00:16:01,230
Hexside.

407
00:16:01,230 --> 00:16:03,330
Y esa es la manera de robar un

408
00:16:03,330 --> 00:16:04,310
